{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwFGuQ5jb9oX2eb4ygV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've finished reading the five screens. Here's what I'd tell my son.\n\n\"Look, from what I understood, the current account costs up to 10 shekels a month on the basic track, the 'מסלול הבסיסי'. They also wrote that from 1.10.2026 there's a new rule: up to 5 shekels for up to two actions a month, and up to 10 for three to a hundred. I don't do many actions, so it's probably 5 or 10 shekels. I'm not sure which rule applies to me now. They wrote dates, 01.10.2026 and 01.07.2027, and I didn't understand when the old one ends.\n\nHow much to keep in it: the page says money you don't need that day shouldn't sit there. Above 15,000 ₪ for a whole quarter, the bank has to send you a letter offering alternatives. So I'd keep what we need for the month, and I'm not sure about the rest. They suggest something called 'קרן כספית יומית', which I don't know, and I won't put money into what I don't know. I'm not very sure about any of this. I'll ask you, or the clerk at the bank, before I change anything.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top part, \"מה זה\". The fees: up to 10 ₪ a month on the basic track, and the new rule with 5 ₪, 10 ₪ and 1 ₪ for each action over a hundred.\n2. \"כמה ריבית מקבלים בעו\"ש\":\n   - The 15,000 ₪ line.\n   - The calculator: 10,000 ₪ left for 10 years would be worth 8,203 ₪, which is 1,797 less. I typed nothing. There's a slider there and I didn't touch it.\n3. The colored chart. I didn't try to read it.\n4. Under the chart, another number: \"המחיר של להשאיר 2,576 ₪\". I didn't understand why it isn't 1,797.\n5. \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\". It says there is no deposit insurance in Israel and that if a bank collapses, no law gives the money back. That scared me and I stopped there.\n6. I only glanced at the word list at the bottom. I didn't open the folds, \"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית\" and \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The deposit-insurance part.\n- Two different numbers for the same loss.\n- The dark background with grey writing, hard to read.\n- Small labels in English letters, like \"BANK-17\".\n- Small orange circles next to the amounts, and I don't know what they mean.\n- \"123 מקור / 123 מחושב\" at the top."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1990,"cache_read_input_tokens":11909,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1990},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"103e904f-2671-4e04-99ea-05c2f68ce6cc","uuid":"2038a1c8-0daa-46ed-805e-75f01fae6971","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:06:59.178Z","request_id":"req_011CgkwFGhzqHp1e1ErJ6UFX"}
